---
import Layout from "@/components/Layout.astro"
import Logo from "@/components/Logo.astro"
---

<Layout>
  <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center items-center">
    <h1 class="-translate-x-2"><Logo /> Zigland</h1>
    <p class="font-bold text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">
      Evolve together with
      <a href="https://ziglang.org" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">Zig</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-500">
      Zigland is your hub for learning and exploring the Zig programming language, and more broadly,
      system programming. My vision is to build a space that offers a comprehensive tutorial, an
      interactive playground, a language cheat sheet like
      <a href="https://cheats.rs" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">cheats.rs</a>,
      and regular posts about Zig and its community. The site is still under development, but I look
      forward to exploring the Zig world together with you!
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
